    "text": "It is hereby notified as per the schedule 1 of industrial Promotion Act, No. 46 of 1990 which was published as supplement under Section II of the Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka dated 07th of December 1990, I appoint Mr. Yakupity Indika Manjula Silva who is carrying out the duties as the Additional Secretary (Industry & Industrial Estate Development) of the Ministry of Industry and Entrepreneurship Development as the Registrar of industries for the relevant activities of industrial Registration in terms of Section 27 under Sub-section (I) of the above Act.",
